WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:22.692
The next day Henry took Rabbit all over the house.

2
00:00:22.693 --> 00:00:28.086
He rode Rabbit on Car.

3
00:00:28.087 --> 00:00:35.815
He marched Rabbit with Soldier.

4
00:00:35.816 --> 00:00:39.643
He stomped Rabbit through a dinosaur jungle.

5
00:00:39.644 --> 00:00:47.781
The dinosaurs roared like angry beasts.

6
00:00:47.782 --> 00:00:51.142
"This is fun!" Rabbit thought.

7
00:00:51.143 --> 00:00:57.163
Rabbit loved exploring the house.

8
00:00:57.164 --> 00:01:05.760
He loved sliding down the stairs.

9
00:01:05.761 --> 00:01:13.789
He loved watching birds out the window.

10
00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:19.958
He especially loved playing with Henry.

11
00:01:19.959 --> 00:01:24.760
That night Henry put all the toys away.

12
00:01:24.761 --> 00:01:33.543
Rabbit sat on a shelf.

13
00:01:33.544 --> 00:01:36.522
"Oh no," Rabbit said.

14
00:01:36.523 --> 00:01:39.417
"My nose and paws are dirty.

15
00:01:39.418 --> 00:01:44.849
And my tail lost some of its fluff."

16
00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:48.869
"I knew you were weak!" Robot said.

17
00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:53.809
Horse rolled his eyes.

18
00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:56.270
"Don't listen to him, Rabbit.

19
00:01:56.271 --> 00:01:58.905
Those changes are normal.

20
00:01:58.906 --> 00:02:02.622
It's part of becoming real."

21
00:02:02.623 --> 00:02:06.891
"Real?" Rabbit said. "What's that?"

22
00:02:06.892 --> 00:02:11.191
"Becoming real is wonderful," Horse said.

23
00:02:11.192 --> 00:02:15.317
"It's when a toy comes alive.

24
00:02:15.318 --> 00:02:20.541
We are alive in a child's mind forever."

25
00:02:20.542 --> 00:02:24.563
"That does sound wonderful!" Rabbit said.

26
00:02:24.564 --> 00:02:27.285
"I want to become real!"

27
00:02:27.286 --> 00:02:32.049
Horse smiled. "Maybe you will one day."

28
00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:38.394
Robot laughed. "You'll never be real, Rabbit!

29
00:02:38.395 --> 00:02:42.686
You can't do any cool stuff—like I can!"

30
00:02:42.687 --> 00:02:44.978
Robot flashed his lights.

31
00:02:44.979 --> 00:02:48.201
He shot out his claw.

32
00:02:48.202 --> 00:02:50.442
Rabbit frowned.

33
00:02:50.443 --> 00:02:53.446
"I'll show you, Robot!" he thought.

34
00:02:53.447 --> 00:02:56.692
"I'll show everyone.

35
00:02:56.693 --> 00:03:05.750
One day I'll be real!"

